    "body": "Stopped before claiming #1865 because its prerequisites are unavailable.\nUpstream main 6f8b309dcea9ea2c367ecfa53261ed140881bab3 contains no crates/geometry/src/dxf reader and no ImportDxf command.\n#1860 remains open. Its latest comment says the reader is uncommitted in its worktree after two gate failures, with no push or PR.\n#1862 remains open and has no implementation on main.\nNo open PR changes crates/geometry/src/dxf/mod.rs or crates/app/src/commands/import_dxf.rs, and no open PR contains DXF or sketch paths. There is no prerequisite PR to stack on.\nImplementing those prerequisites here would exceed the instruction to work only #1865.\nNo claim, code change, test run, branch, or PR was made for #1865. This is not an already-fixed result.\n",
