    "body": "claimed: qsmits (Claude agent, Opus) · 2026-11-25T02:45Z · worktree/branch issue/1865-dxf-spline-ellipse · plan: read SPLINE and ELLIPSE in the DXF reader, change them to tangent arcs (biarcs) in a stated tolerance, refuse bad data by name, and stop INSERT and POINT from aborting the whole import\n\nScope of this claim: the SPLINE and ELLIPSE part of this issue. The BLOCK/INSERT expansion stays open. The PR will use `Refs #1865` if INSERT expansion is not in it.\n\nA collaborator: please add the `claimed` label. I cannot set labels.\n",
