    "body": "fix on issue/1865-dxf-spline-ellipse · PR #3958 · pinned by curves::closed_cubic_spline_reads_as_tangent_arcs_within_the_bound, curves::ellipses_read_as_tangent_arcs_and_a_round_one_stays_a_circle, curve_refusals::malformed_splines_are_refused_by_name, curve_refusals::malformed_ellipses_are_refused_by_name, arcs::closed_spline_die_cuts_as_tangent_arcs_and_posts_its_golden · merges at the next cut\n\nThe PR covers SPLINE and ELLIPSE (tangent arcs within 1 µm, two-sided). INSERT and POINT are skipped and counted, so they do not stop the import now. BLOCK and INSERT expansion is not in the PR. The PR uses `Refs #1865`, so this issue stays open for block expansion.\n\nA collaborator: please replace `claimed` with `in-review`. I cannot set labels. Follow-up: #3959.\n",
